# After every change

SSOT: `docs/AGENT_DEVELOPMENT.md`. Efficiency: `test-efficiency.mdc`.

## Edit loop

```bash
python3 scripts/agent_context.py
python3 scripts/test_plan.py --dev-scope --explain
python3 scripts/run_dev_loop.py
```

Habitual agent check: `run_dev_loop.py` (≤60s). Checkpoint: `--commit-gate` (≤120s).

## Do not (during edits)

- `scripts/ci.sh` after every small edit or every «продолжи»
- Pipe CI through `tail` / `tee`
- Skip safety clusters after mutation-path changes (commit gate adds them)

## Domain extras

| Touched | Also |
|---------|------|
| `spell_sync/application/` or architecture scripts | `python3 scripts/check_architecture.py --check` |
| Mutation paths (Pull/Push/Recovery/lock) | skill `mutation-safety-audit` |
| TUI screens / controller | skill `tui-flow` |
| Diagnostics / redaction | skill `diagnostics-change` |
| Packaging / wheel | skill `installed-wheel-smoke` when packaging changed |

## Full CI (owner publish / final only)

```bash
scripts/ci.sh
python3 scripts/check_ci_evidence.py
```

On failure: `python3 scripts/dev_runs.py failures`, `CI_SUMMARY` / `CI_LOG`.
